<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6423] PDS could be corrupted if partition have been evicted and owned again</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6423</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;So, what is going on? &lt;br/&gt;
Partition had been changed, its pages had been put to checkpoint pages.&lt;br/&gt;
After it partition was evicted, checkpoint started.&lt;br/&gt;
We are allocating a page and because it&apos;s already in checkpoint we copy the empty page to copy it on disk.&lt;br/&gt;
If we restart right now we will read the empty page from disk. Therefore assertion error would be thrown etc.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
